iry in window</td></tr></table>\n<h3>\ud83d\udd0d Call/put deep dive: next to explode</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#777\">Bias (\u2212100 to +100) blends today's put/call volume (30%), put/call open interest (20%), 1\u03c3 skew (20%) and estimated net premium (30%). Bull at +25 or more, Bear at \u221225 or less, otherwise Base. Net premium counts a trade at or above mid as bought, which is an estimate: Yahoo shows only each contract's last print. Bear/Base/Bull prices come from the options' own implied distribution, using put IV for the downside and call IV for the upside. There is about a 16% chance of finishing below Bear, 50% inside Base, and 16% above Bull.</p>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;margin:10px 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><b>CCI</b> $66.76 \u00b7 <span style=\"color:#1a7f37;font-weight:600\">\ud83d\udfe2 Bull +88</span> <span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px\">\u00b7 Real estate \u00b7 score 64</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:6px\">\ud83d\udd34 Bear <b>$62.25</b> (-7%) \u00b7 \u26aa Base <b>$63.68\u2013$69.95</b> \u00b7 \ud83d\udfe2 Bull <b>$71.55</b> (7%) <span style=\"color:#777\">by 10-16</span></div>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:6px\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:13px\">Catalysts</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:13px\">Oct 21: Earnings</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:13px\">Options volume today</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:13px\">2,365 (86% calls) \u00b7 put/call 0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:13px\">Open interest</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:13px\">18,882 \u00b7 put/call 0.56</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:13px\">Skew (1\u03c3 ris